extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x995ZEJqGSYQ7kNvwGPD_Fo&_nc_oc=AdpAxa2zWHIXQPzNfckE8h5RwF-OV4u352xqGLM50SL6NwB5KdtwB-riq7FJQVMKG3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5YVB-ZNDaoFc-rixwV3r9-f7_OILryj8MOfxXEtkrLw&oe=6AE758D6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ksCYZJvpd58Q7kNvwFFIoHw&_nc_oc=AdosN5NbCrsJx9l19JcvXpH9qKTPuNxHGdZAZqaiVSak6dQH8sAGpcfy3S1hqgKEz5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ7CdTvBt0dURLGuzUhD92oRRwWZSH7EIButl7fFH55IQ&oe=6AE76022"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kqQ9CT1jFzgQ7kNvwEOENzB&_nc_oc=AdoA2xz7VHvSzc2EyeylBLOQBioQ4zknoqsZ0Mo_qeLMcJOO7ytezCzAhjFt55MZS84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfs6CQcVQiXW5iTUCqPgH2zG2mNVl90dF5DK29JVlflw&oe=6AE76819"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":